  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Here, we use the BODMAS table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e10e3be1476caf1bd7e2e109842e7c57ce86da0c54b1b539e233e4e6a7748a44.png] \n\nGiven:\n\n⇒ 321 * 3 * 236 * 5 * 248 * 4 * 20 = 384\n\n(1) **+, -, ×, +, ÷, ×**\n\n⇒ 321 * 3 * 236 * 5 * 248 * 4 * 20 = 384\n\nAfter putting the signs:\n\n⇒ 321 + 3 - 236 × 5 + __**248 ÷ 4**__ × 20 = 384\n\nApply BODMAS rule:\n\n⇒ 321 + 3 - __**236 × 5**__ + __**62 × 20**__\n\n⇒ 321 + 3 - 1180 + 1240\n\n⇒ 1564 - 1180 = **384**\n\n⇒ '321 + 3 - 236 × 5 + 248 ÷ 4 × 20 = 384'\n\nHere, the equation is **satisfied.**\n\n(2) **-, +, ×, -, ÷, +**\n\n⇒ 321 * 3 * 236 * 5 * 248 * 4 * 20 = 384\n\nAfter putting the signs:\n\n⇒ 321 - 3 + 236 × 5 - __**248 ÷ 4**__ + 20 = 384\n\nApply BODMAS rule:\n\n⇒ 321 - 3 + __**236 × 5**__ - 62 + 20\n\n⇒ 321 - 3 + 1180 - 62 + 20\n\n⇒ 1521 - 65 = 1456\n\nHere, the equation is not satisfied.\n\n(3) **÷, +, -, ×, +, -**\n\n⇒ 321 * 3 * 236 * 5 * 248 * 4 * 20 = 384\n\nAfter putting the signs:\n\n⇒ __**321 ÷ 3**__ + 236 - 5 × 248 + 4 - 20 = 384\n\nApply BODMAS rule:\n\n⇒ 107 + 236 - __**5 × 248**__ + 4 - 20\n\n⇒ 107 + 236 - 1240 + 4 - 20\n\n⇒ 347 - 1260 = (-913)\n\nHere, the equation is not satisfied.\n\n(4) **×, +, -, ÷, +, -**\n\n⇒ 321 * 3 * 236 * 5 * 248 * 4 * 20 = 384\n\nAfter putting the signs:\n\n⇒ 321 × 3 + 236 - __**5 ÷ 248**__ + 4 - 20 = 384\n\nApply BODMAS rule:\n\n⇒ __**321 × 3**__ + 236 - 0.0201 + 4 - 20\n\n⇒ 963 + 236 - 0.0201 + 4 - 20\n\n⇒ 1203 - 20.02 = 1182.97\n\nHere, the equation is not satisfied.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (1)\".",
